</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>7.4V</strong></td>
<td>16.5 kg·cm @ 6V</td>
<td>5V 电源</td>
<td>✅ 标准配置，足够使用</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>12V</strong></td>
<td>30 kg·cm</td>
<td>12V 5A+ 电源</td>
